    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(b) the person owned, had a right to possess or had other property in the thing immediately before the forfeiture.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The person is entitled to compensation for the forfeited electronic equipment during the period of ownership.";
