    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "judicial proceeding means (other than in section 3L): a proceeding in or before a court; or a proceeding: before a body, or a person, acting under a law of the Commonwealth, of a State or of a Territory; and in which evidence may be taken on oath.";
