    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Prohibition of influencing a witness in a judicial proceeding.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(a) the first person does so upon an agreement or understanding that any person called, or to be called, as a witness in a judicial proceeding will: (i) give false testimony; or (ii) withhold true testimony;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The first person commits an offence if...";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::logic::deontic";
