    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(3) A person commits an offence if:  (a) the person does an act; and  (b) the person does so with the intention of inducing a person called, or to be called, as a witness in a judicial proceeding:";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The person must not induce false testimony.";
