    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/modality> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Deontic>;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "Prohibit";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Prohibits aiding prisoner to escape.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(1) A person (the first person) commits an offence if:  (a) another person (the prisoner) is in criminal detention; and  (b) the first person aids the prisoner:  (i) to escape from that detention; or  (ii) to attempt to escape from that detention; and  (c) the prisoner escapes, or attempts to escape, from that detention;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "Aiding prisoner to escape is prohibited.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/executionSurface> "modalities::logic::deontic";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/confidence> 1.0000;
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/curationStatus> <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/Proposed>.
